This is Moret–Bailly, *Groupes de Picard et problèmes de Skolem
II*, Ann. Sci. ÉNS 22 (1989), **Théorème 1.3**, §3 (the curve case; §2 is
the hyperplane-section reduction, which is this file's Bertini sibling), in
